flowchart LR
    A[Day 13: 10K diagnostic] --> B[10K short screening]
    B --> C{Health checks pass?}
    C -->|no| D[Fix or reject config]
    C -->|yes| E[100K main comparison]
    E --> F[25K / 50K / 75K / 100K diagnostics]
    F --> G[Compare curves and stability]
    G --> H{Reliable signal?}
    H -->|yes| I[Keep candidate for multi-seed evaluation]
    H -->|no| J[Report that ranking is unresolved]
